We have increased our campaigning among retirees, stressing ERC's commitment to for a secure and expanded social pension system in a future Catalan Republic. [? if joan_tarda_advisor: Joan Tardà is proving especially effective at reaching this audience. ?][? if broken_roadmap: Our failure to fulfil our independence roadmap makes them distrustful of our messages, though. ?]

